        "severity": "warning",
        "message": "This composition has 26 elements carrying \"heavy overlay\" CSS (filter:blur, radial-gradient, or clip-path). Field signal: a composition with ~40 such elements (including opacity:0 / visibility:hidden ones) captures solid-black for the first ~half of the render, recovering near the end. Reproduces identically via drawElement, forced screenshot capture, and snapshot, so the capture layer itself is the offender (not encoder/mux). Independent of duration. Presence alone matters; only display:none elements are excluded here.",
